A plan with no sidecar anywhere — its reviews' directory holds none either — prints the single
line `no corrections for {plan}`, exit 0.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/p/index.md --
---
title: P
code_reviews:
  - codereviews/p/202610161000.md
  - codereviews/p/202610171100.md
---

# P
-- cmd --
booping correction list --plan plans/p/index.md
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
no corrections for plans/p/index.md
-- stderr --
